  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 350.",
    "Cut onion in 4, put into food processor and chop up with S-blade.",
    "Add in the eggs, salt, and sprinkle white pepper all around and mix.",
    "Add oil into a 9x13 tin and put into the oven.",
    "Replace the S-blade with the grinder blade and grind in the potatoes and zucchini until it's full.",
    "Put the batter into a bowl and mix.",
    "Pour hot oil into batter while mixing.",
    "Pour water into the batter and mix.",
    "Broil on 525 for 4-5 minutes, or until the top browns.",
    "Switch oven to bake 350 and let it bake for 3 ¼ hours."
